1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:01,770
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:01,770 --> 00:00:03,540
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,240
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:07,850
(Episode 48)

5
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,120
So this is where Ae Sook works?

6
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:15,820
Unbelievable.

7
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:17,260
Joo Ae Sook.

8
00:00:18,290 --> 00:00:20,020
You've really made it.

9
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:28,300
What the heck?

10
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:29,970
Gosh, I'm so sorry.

11
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:32,840
What are you doing?
Are you kidding me?

12
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,440
Why is nothing going my way today?

13
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,710
I'm sorry. What should I do?

14
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:42,250
What are you looking at?

15
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:47,920
Well, if you give me your card,
I can pay for dry cleaning later.

16
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:49,750
Do you have any idea
how much this outfit costs?

17
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,390
Dry cleaning? Give me a break.
Forget it.

18
00:01:03,230 --> 00:01:04,340
What happened?

19
00:01:06,910 --> 00:01:08,270
This is so annoying.

20
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:12,910
Come on, let's go.

21
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:15,050
Darn, it's completely ruined.

22
00:01:23,350 --> 00:01:24,620
Unbelievable.

23
00:01:35,370 --> 00:01:38,800
I know I put it in my pocket.

24
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:44,240
Could it be...

25
00:01:45,180 --> 00:01:46,180
That night?

26
00:02:04,430 --> 00:02:07,170
Even if the police did find it,

27
00:02:07,230 --> 00:02:09,470
they likely wouldn't have seen it
as key evidence.

28
00:02:10,030 --> 00:02:11,700
Then let's go find it ourselves.

29
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,970
So it wasn't a random crime?

30
00:02:16,140 --> 00:02:18,580
Hyun Jae was looking for something?

31
00:02:20,510 --> 00:02:23,150
Yes, most likely.

32
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:27,050
Does this perhaps have something...

33
00:02:27,550 --> 00:02:29,720
to do with you, Eun Seol?

34
00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:35,430
I already knew Hyun Jae
was preparing for your retrial.

35
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:45,870
So, Hyun Jae...

36
00:02:46,100 --> 00:02:47,840
ended up like that...

37
00:02:48,170 --> 00:02:50,310
while trying to help Eun Seol?

38
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:56,080
You fool.

39
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:11,030
(Cheongma Group's 50th Anniversary:
Announcing a Global Leap Forward)

40
00:03:11,100 --> 00:03:13,530
She looks remarkably similar.

41
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,740
There might be more to this.

42
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:26,780
Kang Hae Ra,
the head of the Design Team?

43
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:33,650
I, An Guk Cheol,
can't stand unanswered questions.

44
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,290
I was getting bored
out of my mind anyway.

45
00:03:38,860 --> 00:03:40,590
For once,
my blood's actually pumping.

46
00:03:41,590 --> 00:03:42,890
It's pumping for sure.

47
00:03:46,530 --> 00:03:48,370
(Cheongma)

48
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:51,740
Here's the candidate selection plan
for the new scholarship program.

49
00:03:57,980 --> 00:04:00,550
You've prepared this already?

50
00:04:02,610 --> 00:04:04,420
Given what happened to Mr. Seo,

51
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:06,750
I figured you'd need more time.

52
00:04:08,090 --> 00:04:10,760
As expected,
you're very resilient, Eun Seol.

53
00:04:11,260 --> 00:04:13,560
I have no time to waste on emotions.

54
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,030
We're at work, after all.

55
00:04:15,230 --> 00:04:19,560
Still, seeing you stay so composed
is truly admirable.

56
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:23,640
By the way, I heard Ms. Kang
was newly assigned...

57
00:04:23,700 --> 00:04:25,200
to the scholarship program.

58
00:04:25,300 --> 00:04:27,070
How is working together working out?

59
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:29,870
Since she's still reviewing
our progress so far,

60
00:04:29,940 --> 00:04:31,540
it'll probably take a while.

61
00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:36,580
Please make sure to give her
a lot of support.

62
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:38,650
I can't speak for the others,

63
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,890
but she'll need someone like you
by her side.

64
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,120
Me?

65
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,320
Of course.

66
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:48,630
Ms. Kang isn't someone
who can run on her own.

67
00:04:48,890 --> 00:04:51,260
She needs someone
running right next to her...

68
00:04:51,330 --> 00:04:54,030
to stay motivated and push harder.

69
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:57,140
In that sense,

70
00:04:57,200 --> 00:05:00,140
I think you'd make
a great pacemaker for her.

71
00:05:00,770 --> 00:05:02,840
Working alongside her,
you can grow as well.

72
00:05:05,580 --> 00:05:07,880
Try to be a big help to her.

73
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,580
Yes, I'll do that.

74
00:05:16,420 --> 00:05:18,620
Right. You were looking for me?

75
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,460
Yes, I have something to ask you.

76
00:05:24,530 --> 00:05:26,860
Shoejoy isn't
under my control anymore,

77
00:05:26,930 --> 00:05:28,930
so what could you possibly
want to ask me?

78
00:05:29,970 --> 00:05:32,040
Go ahead, speak freely.

79
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:35,310
This might be a bit
of a personal question.

80
00:05:37,740 --> 00:05:39,940
What was your relationship
with my father?

81
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:42,050
What? With Seong Woo?

82
00:05:44,620 --> 00:05:46,680
What kind of relationship
did we have?

83
00:05:47,390 --> 00:05:50,350
Don't you already know all about it,
Chief Cha?

84
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:53,290
He and I joined the company
at the same time.

85
00:05:54,030 --> 00:05:56,890
And we've stayed close ever since.

86
00:05:58,030 --> 00:06:00,870
Seong Woo was basically
like a brother to me.

87
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:04,970
I assumed you already knew that.

88
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:08,040
Was there ever any tension...

89
00:06:08,740 --> 00:06:12,110
or a major falling out
between the two of you?

90
00:06:15,810 --> 00:06:17,010
No.

91
00:06:17,950 --> 00:06:19,020
Never.

92
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:23,690
Maybe with others,
but with Seong Woo,

93
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:26,790
we never once raised our voices
at each other.

94
00:06:27,490 --> 00:06:29,890
He had such a gentle nature.

95
00:06:30,730 --> 00:06:31,730
I see.

96
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:33,300
But...

97
00:06:34,030 --> 00:06:37,900
why the sudden interest
in that, Chief Cha?

98
00:06:40,170 --> 00:06:42,110
Something my mother said
was bothering me.

99
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,810
Please don't worry about it.

100
00:06:44,180 --> 00:06:46,440
My mother must have been mistaken.

101
00:06:48,980 --> 00:06:50,880
Right, that can happen.

102
00:06:51,820 --> 00:06:52,920
By the way,

103
00:06:52,980 --> 00:06:57,190
So Yeon's routine checkup
is coming up soon, isn't it?

104
00:06:58,090 --> 00:06:59,090
Yes.

105
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,530
Right.

106
00:07:00,790 --> 00:07:02,160
No matter how busy you are,

107
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:05,160
make sure you keep track
of her checkups.

108
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:07,730
Yes, I will.

109
00:07:11,140 --> 00:07:12,900
(CEO Kang Young Hoon)

110
00:07:13,070 --> 00:07:15,070
That dimwit.

111
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:18,410
What on earth
has she been blabbing about?

112
00:07:28,490 --> 00:07:30,050
Did you call for me, sir?

113
00:07:30,350 --> 00:07:31,360
Right.

114
00:07:31,390 --> 00:07:32,420
Today,

115
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:35,190
you said you and my wife
are meeting So Yeon, right?

116
00:07:35,660 --> 00:07:36,660
Yes, sir.

117
00:07:36,790 --> 00:07:39,430
We're meeting So Yeon
to set an engagement date.

118
00:07:39,700 --> 00:07:40,900
While you're there,

119
00:07:40,970 --> 00:07:43,700
take a very close look at
how So Yeon is doing.

120
00:07:44,540 --> 00:07:46,200
Did something happen?

121
00:07:46,300 --> 00:07:47,870
No, nothing like that.

122
00:07:48,170 --> 00:07:49,840
There are just some things
I need to check.

123
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:53,680
Actually, sometime later,

124
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:56,710
I'd like to meet So Yeon
in person with you.

125
00:07:57,680 --> 00:08:00,920
Understood.
Since the Chairman is quite busy,

126
00:08:00,990 --> 00:08:03,490
I'll arrange a sit-down
for just the two of us.

127
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:05,820
Set it up as soon as possible.

128
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:20,200
Sir.

129
00:08:21,310 --> 00:08:23,040
Please don't worry too much.

130
00:08:24,140 --> 00:08:25,380
Remember what I said?

131
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:27,810
I told you I'd protect you.

132
00:08:29,550 --> 00:08:30,820
Thank you, Director Joo.

133
00:08:44,700 --> 00:08:47,400
If I dangle some bait right now,

134
00:08:47,570 --> 00:08:49,730
he'll walk right into the trap.

135
00:08:51,870 --> 00:08:54,440
What would Kang Young Hoon
drool over?

136
00:08:55,570 --> 00:08:57,640
(PR Director Joo Mi Ran)

137
00:09:02,150 --> 00:09:04,750
Should I coax Chief Cha's mom?

138
00:09:09,090 --> 00:09:10,660
Was there ever any tension...

139
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:14,760
or a major falling out
between the two of you?

140
00:09:18,460 --> 00:09:19,660
No.

141
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,570
Never.

142
00:09:23,430 --> 00:09:26,300
Maybe with others,
but with Seong Woo,

143
00:09:26,970 --> 00:09:29,540
we never once raised our voices
at each other.

144
00:09:30,140 --> 00:09:32,410
He had such a gentle nature.

145
00:09:33,010 --> 00:09:35,850
Then why did Mom say
something like that?

146
00:09:38,050 --> 00:09:39,350
Something feels off.

147
00:09:45,890 --> 00:09:48,230
Does this perhaps have something...

148
00:09:48,790 --> 00:09:50,800
to do with you, Eun Seol?

149
00:09:54,570 --> 00:09:57,640
I already knew Hyun Jae
was preparing for your retrial.

150
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,480
You were already here?

151
00:10:07,850 --> 00:10:10,250
Yes, I finished lunch a bit early.

152
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:15,520
Is Ms. Kang joining us today
as well?

153
00:10:16,390 --> 00:10:18,260
Yes, she probably will.

154
00:10:18,460 --> 00:10:19,990
She's bound to be late,

155
00:10:20,420 --> 00:10:22,260
so we might as well start
without her.

156
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,600
Why do we have meetings so often?

157
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,910
Secretary Choi, please send out...

158
00:10:38,980 --> 00:10:41,050
the official letters
to the local governments.

159
00:10:41,050 --> 00:10:42,680
Ms. Kang,
please gather the materials...

160
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:43,950
for the promotional video.

161
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:48,220
You're really enjoying playing boss,
aren't you?

162
00:10:48,350 --> 00:10:49,490
Ms. Kang.

163
00:10:50,420 --> 00:10:52,120
Does this look like the Design Team
to you?

164
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:53,420
What?

165
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:55,560
When it comes
to the scholarship program,

166
00:10:55,630 --> 00:10:57,600
Ms. Ko is your senior.

167
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:02,400
If that makes you uncomfortable,
you're free to leave right now.

168
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:07,370
People who have nothing
sure love to stick together.

169
00:11:07,810 --> 00:11:10,440
You can't take me on alone,
so you're ganging up on me?

170
00:11:12,740 --> 00:11:14,680
Can't you read the room?

171
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:18,320
Ko Eun Seol might lead
the scholarship program,

172
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:21,220
but I'm the next chairman
of the scholarship foundation.

173
00:11:21,290 --> 00:11:22,820
"Next" means...

174
00:11:24,820 --> 00:11:27,120
you haven't made it yet.

175
00:11:27,530 --> 00:11:29,030
Unbelievable...

176
00:11:35,470 --> 00:11:37,640
Great work, Eun Seol.

177
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:41,970
Thank you, Secretary Choi. You too.

178
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:50,150
Director Joo, do I really have
to work with those things?

179
00:11:51,380 --> 00:11:52,550
Those things?

180
00:11:52,850 --> 00:11:54,950
Ko Eun Seol and Choi Jun Hwan.

181
00:11:54,950 --> 00:11:58,020
The pair of them gang up on me
and get totally on my nerves.

182
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,990
They make me sick,
and I can't stand them.

183
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:03,230
Just hang in there for now.

184
00:12:04,100 --> 00:12:07,000
We'll push for a new
scholarship program under your name.

185
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:10,700
When, exactly?
Besides, would Mom even approve it?

186
00:12:12,370 --> 00:12:15,840
Don't worry.
The CEO promised to help us.

187
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,410
Dad said that?

188
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:20,140
But Mom's the one
who runs the scholarship foundation.

189
00:12:20,210 --> 00:12:21,950
Who says it has to be that way?

190
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:25,020
If you and the CEO present
a united front,

191
00:12:25,220 --> 00:12:27,490
the Chairman will have to back down.

192
00:12:28,220 --> 00:12:29,420
Do you really think so?

193
00:12:30,390 --> 00:12:32,220
I'll make sure it happens,

194
00:12:32,590 --> 00:12:34,690
so endure it for now,
even if you hate it.

195
00:12:35,230 --> 00:12:37,330
Once you solidify your place
at the foundation,

196
00:12:37,630 --> 00:12:40,830
you can fire someone
like Ko Eun Seol yourself anytime.

197
00:12:41,570 --> 00:12:44,700
Right, that's always an option.

198
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:48,010
Suddenly,
I really feel like working hard.

199
00:12:48,110 --> 00:12:50,340
I'll do a really good job
at the scholarship foundation.

200
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:59,220
So much dust...

201
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:03,290
Wait, isn't the cafe closed today?

202
00:13:03,490 --> 00:13:06,860
Yes, it is,
but I have somewhere to go.

203
00:13:06,890 --> 00:13:07,890
Where?

204
00:13:09,190 --> 00:13:11,900
Don't tell me you're off to comfort
that woman again.

205
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:14,600
Grandma, there's no need to be
so condescending.

206
00:13:14,830 --> 00:13:16,600
Could you show her
a little respect...

207
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:19,140
and call her Teun Teun's mom,
Mi Rae, or my boss?

208
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:21,970
Do you really have to call her
such degrading names?

209
00:13:22,470 --> 00:13:24,810
This is all your fault, you know.

210
00:13:24,910 --> 00:13:27,280
Watching the two of you
glued together...

211
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:29,450
makes my stomach churn,

212
00:13:29,450 --> 00:13:31,150
so how can I say anything nice?

213
00:13:31,950 --> 00:13:33,180
See?

214
00:13:33,380 --> 00:13:35,120
That's just because
you're so bitter, Grandma.

215
00:13:36,220 --> 00:13:37,720
Where are you going?

216
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:40,890
To look around the place
where Attorney Seo died.

217
00:13:41,060 --> 00:13:42,360
I'll be late today.

218
00:13:42,430 --> 00:13:43,430
What...

219
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:45,160
How can I say anything nice...

220
00:13:45,230 --> 00:13:47,630
when you bend over backwards
for her?

221
00:13:49,730 --> 00:13:51,740
This darn place.

222
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:54,070
We should just move out.

223
00:13:54,310 --> 00:13:55,570
Unbelievable.

224
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:06,050
Eun Seol,

225
00:14:06,250 --> 00:14:09,390
I think I found
what Hyun Jae received.

226
00:14:09,890 --> 00:14:11,920
Let's meet at the cafe this evening.

227
00:14:31,210 --> 00:14:32,210
That's good news.

228
00:14:32,310 --> 00:14:34,210
I'll go straight to the cafe
after work.

229
00:14:57,270 --> 00:14:59,000
Awesome.

230
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:15,490
Seo Teun Teun.
Hurry and eat your meal.

231
00:15:22,260 --> 00:15:23,690
Yes, come in.

232
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:28,030
- Are you ready?
- Yes. Did you pack So Yeon's gift?

233
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:29,230
Yes, I did.

234
00:15:29,230 --> 00:15:31,600
If we leave now,
I think we'll arrive on time.

235
00:15:31,640 --> 00:15:33,600
Good. While we're there,

236
00:15:33,670 --> 00:15:35,910
let's get Chief Cha's tuxedo size.

237
00:15:36,010 --> 00:15:38,310
I keep forgetting to ask every time.

238
00:15:38,380 --> 00:15:41,080
- Sure, I'll find out.
- Let's go.

239
00:15:43,250 --> 00:15:46,680
Hae Ra chose this specially
for you, So Yeon.

240
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:48,890
That's right.

241
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,190
Hae Ra was worried
you might not like it,

242
00:15:51,360 --> 00:15:53,060
so she spent a long time
picking it out.

243
00:15:55,790 --> 00:15:58,600
She wasn't lying after all.

244
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:00,560
What?

245
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:06,940
Hae Ra said she was filthy rich.

246
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:12,140
She said she could...

247
00:16:12,140 --> 00:16:16,210
make Seok Jin happy
because she's rich.

248
00:16:17,750 --> 00:16:19,480
So that's what you meant.

249
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:22,220
It's not simply
because she's wealthy.

250
00:16:22,420 --> 00:16:24,420
Hae Ra's feelings for Chief Cha...

251
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:29,260
She truly cares for Seok Jin deeply.

252
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:32,660
Ever since high school,

253
00:16:33,060 --> 00:16:35,300
Seok Jin was the only one for her.

254
00:16:37,370 --> 00:16:38,870
I see.

255
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:48,510
I don't need any of this.

256
00:16:49,410 --> 00:16:54,150
Besides, I don't need to be rich.

257
00:16:55,050 --> 00:16:57,960
Come on, don't be this way.
Just take it, So Yeon.

258
00:16:58,320 --> 00:17:01,260
Why not try it on?

259
00:17:01,330 --> 00:17:04,060
- No, I'm fine.
- Come on, try it on.

260
00:17:04,060 --> 00:17:06,430
Let's see how well it suits you.

261
00:17:06,700 --> 00:17:08,070
Goodness.

262
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:14,570
So Yeon, it suits you perfectly.

263
00:17:15,270 --> 00:17:17,570
Yes, it really looks great on you.

264
00:17:18,310 --> 00:17:19,880
I don't like it.

265
00:17:21,710 --> 00:17:22,780
That reminds me.

266
00:17:23,210 --> 00:17:26,450
I need Chief Cha's measurements
for his suit.

267
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,890
I'll find out for you.

268
00:17:29,990 --> 00:17:32,260
You look really lovely, So Yeon.

269
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:35,160
This feels uncomfortable.

270
00:18:12,430 --> 00:18:13,930
Oh, this?

271
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:16,700
It was my father's.

272
00:18:17,970 --> 00:18:19,470
No matter how tough things got,

273
00:18:20,170 --> 00:18:22,910
my father insisted on using
a nice lighter.

274
00:18:24,010 --> 00:18:26,010
I lost it decades ago,

275
00:18:26,610 --> 00:18:29,580
but I asked around and managed
to find the exact same model.

276
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:32,680
Whenever things are not going well
or I feel frustrated,

277
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:35,090
fiddling with it like this...

278
00:18:35,890 --> 00:18:37,890
makes me feel much better.

279
00:18:42,730 --> 00:18:46,300
It looks identical to CEO Kang's.

280
00:19:13,820 --> 00:19:16,730
This is
what you were looking for, right?

281
00:19:17,900 --> 00:19:20,860
Yes, I believe so.

282
00:19:23,130 --> 00:19:25,870
I don't know
what the point of these items is,

283
00:19:26,570 --> 00:19:28,370
but where they came from is obvious.

284
00:19:32,180 --> 00:19:34,810
Manager Na's daughter
gave this to Hyun Jae,

285
00:19:35,750 --> 00:19:36,880
and Manager Na is...

286
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:41,180
connected to you, right?

287
00:19:44,760 --> 00:19:47,060
Yes, that's right.

288
00:19:47,890 --> 00:19:49,330
So, right up until the end,

289
00:19:49,390 --> 00:19:52,800
Hyun Jae died trying to help you.

290
00:19:56,030 --> 00:19:57,030
Eun Seol.

291
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:00,440
You know that Hyun Jae...

292
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:03,270
cared for you deeply, right?

293
00:20:04,010 --> 00:20:05,140
I know everything,

294
00:20:05,380 --> 00:20:08,050
even the fact
that you rejected his feelings.

295
00:20:18,060 --> 00:20:19,360
Take this...

296
00:20:21,490 --> 00:20:23,290
and make sure to uncover...

297
00:20:24,930 --> 00:20:25,930
who did that to him.

298
00:20:32,070 --> 00:20:34,240
And let's not see each other again.

299
00:20:36,970 --> 00:20:37,980
Mi Rae...

300
00:20:39,380 --> 00:20:40,810
I'll tell Eun Guk as well.

301
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:43,450
Let me know
when you find a new place.

302
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:45,180
I'll terminate the lease.

303
00:21:01,530 --> 00:21:03,300
Kang Young Hoon clearly said...

304
00:21:03,800 --> 00:21:07,800
he lost the one he had inherited
from his father.

305
00:21:09,770 --> 00:21:12,640
So how could Chief Cha have
the exact same one?

306
00:21:22,450 --> 00:21:25,660
Sir, there's something
I must tell you.

307
00:21:27,460 --> 00:21:31,530
So Yeon softened up a bit
after getting the gift?

308
00:21:31,700 --> 00:21:35,230
Yes, though I don't think
it was just the gift.

309
00:21:35,830 --> 00:21:38,400
It seemed Hae Ra managed
to persuade her...

310
00:21:38,870 --> 00:21:40,870
by speaking to her on her own level.

311
00:21:42,010 --> 00:21:45,910
Really? I never knew
Hae Ra had it in her.

312
00:21:45,980 --> 00:21:48,610
I know. I was surprised too.

313
00:21:51,350 --> 00:21:53,380
We're going home
together today, right?

314
00:21:53,850 --> 00:21:55,320
Yes, let's do that.

315
00:22:02,360 --> 00:22:03,930
Hold on.

316
00:22:05,030 --> 00:22:07,160
I think you'll have
to head home first.

317
00:22:07,630 --> 00:22:10,130
CEO Park wants a quick word
with me after work.

318
00:22:10,630 --> 00:22:12,700
Sure. I'll see you at home.

319
00:22:13,370 --> 00:22:15,010
Don't be too long, though.

320
00:22:19,180 --> 00:22:23,350
What on earth happened?
Where did you get hurt like this?

321
00:22:23,950 --> 00:22:25,180
I'm fine.

322
00:22:25,420 --> 00:22:27,180
I just lost my footing
and took a tumble.

323
00:22:27,920 --> 00:22:29,350
What's wrong? Wait.

324
00:22:29,950 --> 00:22:32,360
It doesn't look like
anything's broken.

325
00:22:32,420 --> 00:22:33,490
How long will this take to heal?

326
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:35,290
How did this happen?

327
00:22:37,630 --> 00:22:39,900
I went by the place
where Attorney Seo died.

328
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:42,530
You went there to help that woman,
didn't you?

329
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:45,970
Mom, don't get upset.

330
00:22:46,140 --> 00:22:48,140
Just lie down for now.

331
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:50,910
I ought to tie him down right now.

332
00:22:50,970 --> 00:22:52,340
Mom, please.

333
00:22:56,380 --> 00:22:59,480
Here, rest your back against this.

334
00:23:01,720 --> 00:23:04,990
- That boy...
- I told you to just give it up.

335
00:23:05,020 --> 00:23:06,560
How do you expect to rein in...

336
00:23:06,990 --> 00:23:09,560
all that youthful passion
at your age?

337
00:23:09,630 --> 00:23:13,160
Fine, whatever. I give up.

338
00:23:13,330 --> 00:23:15,400
The harder you push,

339
00:23:15,470 --> 00:23:18,370
the more he'll long for her.

340
00:23:19,800 --> 00:23:23,870
Right now,
you're basically laying down...

341
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:27,010
a direct path to her for him.

342
00:23:27,010 --> 00:23:28,650
Forget Cupid's arrow,

343
00:23:28,750 --> 00:23:31,650
you're spearing him
with Cupid's harpoon.

344
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:33,780
What? A harpoon?

345
00:23:34,920 --> 00:23:39,060
Fine. Let's see how you like
getting speared by one.

346
00:23:40,120 --> 00:23:42,190
Why are you taking it out on me?

347
00:23:45,500 --> 00:23:47,700
- Here.
- Thanks.

348
00:23:48,730 --> 00:23:51,600
I scaled a wall and slipped.
That's all.

349
00:23:52,740 --> 00:23:55,770
It's only a hairline fracture,
so it'll heal in no time.

350
00:23:56,270 --> 00:23:57,670
You still should've been
more careful.

351
00:23:59,110 --> 00:24:00,110
That reminds me.

352
00:24:04,180 --> 00:24:05,250
This was lying around.

353
00:24:07,820 --> 00:24:09,050
Doesn't something feel off to you?

354
00:24:09,690 --> 00:24:11,760
I grabbed it just in case.

355
00:24:18,230 --> 00:24:19,560
We've never been...

356
00:24:20,330 --> 00:24:21,800
to a place like this before.

357
00:24:26,300 --> 00:24:27,370
I didn't think...

358
00:24:27,940 --> 00:24:29,840
we could talk openly at home.

359
00:24:32,610 --> 00:24:35,110
Why? Did something happen?

360
00:24:58,840 --> 00:25:00,000
I stumbled across this...

361
00:25:00,670 --> 00:25:02,010
when I was at So Yeon's place.

362
00:25:03,510 --> 00:25:06,640
It's identical to your lighter, sir.

363
00:25:07,940 --> 00:25:09,080
You found this...

364
00:25:09,850 --> 00:25:11,720
at So Yeon's place?

365
00:25:14,080 --> 00:25:16,020
I found it in Chief Cha's room.

366
00:25:19,290 --> 00:25:22,860
Actually, a few days ago,
I saw an identical one at my house.

367
00:25:28,500 --> 00:25:33,070
You clearly told me it was
a keepsake left by your father.

368
00:25:33,900 --> 00:25:35,540
Yes, I did.

369
00:25:37,810 --> 00:25:39,510
I never imagined...

370
00:25:40,940 --> 00:25:42,280
Seong Woo would have it.

371
00:25:50,990 --> 00:25:52,260
You can tell me...

372
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:54,620
everything.

373
00:25:56,190 --> 00:25:59,760
That way,
you'll finally feel relieved.

374
00:26:07,170 --> 00:26:08,340
Seong Woo and I...

375
00:26:09,970 --> 00:26:11,740
started at the company together.

376
00:26:14,310 --> 00:26:16,610
This is totally exhausting.

377
00:26:16,610 --> 00:26:17,880
Tell me about it.

378
00:26:18,480 --> 00:26:22,490
Back then, I never dreamed
that Cheongma would grow this big.

379
00:26:24,290 --> 00:26:29,430
It was just a small business
run by a scholarship foundation.

380
00:26:30,530 --> 00:26:34,000
With the single goal
of growing the company,

381
00:26:34,360 --> 00:26:36,430
Seong Woo and I worked
day and night.

382
00:26:37,230 --> 00:26:40,900
(Special Promotion Notice:
Cha Seong Woo)

383
00:26:40,970 --> 00:26:43,370
Then, I caught
the chairman's eye first.

384
00:26:46,840 --> 00:26:48,750
Around that time, I met my wife,

385
00:26:49,150 --> 00:26:52,150
and I was able to get promoted
faster than Seong Woo.

386
00:26:53,080 --> 00:26:54,620
And then, things went wrong.

387
00:26:54,620 --> 00:26:55,650
(Outsourcing Service Cost Statement)

388
00:26:56,620 --> 00:26:58,690
Resentful of my promotion,

389
00:26:59,220 --> 00:27:01,560
Seong Woo ended up embezzling
company funds.

390
00:27:08,300 --> 00:27:09,870
- Hey, honey.
- Honey,

391
00:27:10,270 --> 00:27:11,670
what's taking you so long?

392
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:14,100
Seok Jin's really angry right now.

393
00:27:14,270 --> 00:27:15,270
I'm sorry about that.

394
00:27:16,140 --> 00:27:17,210
Just hang on a little longer.

395
00:27:21,750 --> 00:27:22,750
Hey, Kang Young Hoon.

396
00:27:26,550 --> 00:27:27,580
Explain this.

397
00:27:28,220 --> 00:27:30,050
You need to stop.

398
00:27:30,050 --> 00:27:31,490
You're going to get
into serious trouble.

399
00:27:31,860 --> 00:27:33,690
This is embezzlement!

400
00:27:34,520 --> 00:27:35,530
Let go of me.

401
00:27:36,660 --> 00:27:38,260
Just keep your mouth shut
and everything will be fine.

402
00:27:40,600 --> 00:27:41,600
Young Hoon.

403
00:27:42,230 --> 00:27:43,270
Let go!

404
00:27:43,270 --> 00:27:44,530
On the day of the accident,

405
00:27:44,600 --> 00:27:46,940
- Kang Young Hoon!
- we had a huge fight.

406
00:27:47,940 --> 00:27:50,210
Seong Woo stormed out
of the company in anger.

407
00:27:51,910 --> 00:27:53,810
And then, he got into an accident.

408
00:28:06,290 --> 00:28:08,690
If I hadn't argued
with him that day,

409
00:28:09,490 --> 00:28:11,290
he wouldn't have been hit
by that truck.

410
00:28:14,930 --> 00:28:15,930
Then,

411
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:18,200
he won't survive.

412
00:28:18,770 --> 00:28:20,740
I'm telling you to kill him.

413
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:22,670
Cha Seong Woo...

414
00:28:23,770 --> 00:28:25,410
can't be left alive.

415
00:28:25,910 --> 00:28:28,280
Then why did you bring
the truck driver...

416
00:28:28,980 --> 00:28:30,550
into Cheongma?

417
00:28:31,750 --> 00:28:34,020
At first, I couldn't forgive him.

418
00:28:36,420 --> 00:28:37,550
But that accident...

419
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:40,820
ruined his life too.

420
00:28:42,930 --> 00:28:46,100
It only happened because
Seong Woo jaywalked while blind with rage.

421
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:49,470
So I wanted to help the driver.

422
00:28:52,940 --> 00:28:55,610
That's why you helped Oh Tae Seop.

423
00:28:58,270 --> 00:29:00,310
If I hadn't fought with Seong Woo,

424
00:29:01,780 --> 00:29:04,180
the driver's life wouldn't have
fallen apart like that.

425
00:29:18,660 --> 00:29:21,500
Holding all this inside
must've been so hard for you.

426
00:29:27,700 --> 00:29:28,710
Until now,

427
00:29:29,270 --> 00:29:31,040
I couldn't tell anyone.

428
00:29:33,140 --> 00:29:34,440
Whenever I looked at Chief Cha,

429
00:29:36,410 --> 00:29:37,980
I was tormented by guilt.

430
00:29:39,520 --> 00:29:43,990
No wonder you were always
looking out for Chief Cha.

431
00:29:44,590 --> 00:29:45,590
That's right.

432
00:29:46,790 --> 00:29:48,960
I wanted to arrange a marriage
between him and Hae Ra...

433
00:29:50,660 --> 00:29:54,530
to somehow ease the burden
on my heart.

434
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:01,200
I understand now...

435
00:30:02,670 --> 00:30:05,110
why you made that choice.

436
00:30:10,710 --> 00:30:11,710
Sir.

437
00:30:30,430 --> 00:30:31,430
Tonight,

438
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:37,340
I want to comfort you.

439
00:30:55,430 --> 00:30:57,830
(2:13 a.m., Friday, October 30)

440
00:33:00,280 --> 00:33:03,990
(A Trap Called Desire)

441
00:33:04,090 --> 00:33:06,560
Usually, after an engagement,
marriage naturally follows.

442
00:33:06,620 --> 00:33:07,690
How come you're bringing this to me?

443
00:33:07,860 --> 00:33:09,690
I was asked to check
if the size fits.

444
00:33:09,690 --> 00:33:11,630
Why would you go there, Eun Guk?

445
00:33:11,860 --> 00:33:13,630
How could I face Eun Seol?

446
00:33:13,700 --> 00:33:15,130
How am I supposed
to look at you, Eun Guk?

447
00:33:15,130 --> 00:33:16,570
What happened last night?

448
00:33:16,770 --> 00:33:19,140
You've never slept anywhere
besides home.

449
00:33:19,340 --> 00:33:21,270
Director Joo, you seem busy lately.

450
00:33:21,270 --> 00:33:25,740
Today, I agreed to tag along
to meet Director Joo's blind date.

451
00:33:26,440 --> 00:33:27,940
September 11?

452
00:33:28,440 --> 00:33:29,710
But the 11th is my birthday.

453
00:33:30,350 --> 00:33:31,910
Joo Ae Sook.

454
00:33:31,980 --> 00:33:34,050
Then Director Joo is...

455
00:33:35,590 --> 00:33:37,590
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
